  "title": "How Image to Video AI Creates Realistic Motion from Photos",
  "summary": "A single photo can tell a story, but a video can bring that story to life. That is the promise behind image to video AI, a technology that takes still images and transforms them into fluid, realistic video clips. What once required frame‑by‑frame animation or expensive production equipment can now happen in seconds with just a photo and a text prompt. For creators, marketers, and everyday users, this opens up possibilities that were hard to imagine just a few years ago. Let us take a closer look at how this technology actually works and why it matters.",
